suite.ndjson.gz is derived from the GROQ test suite by Sanity.io
(https://github.com/sanity-io/groq-test-suite), MIT licensed (see LICENSE),
built from commit f5bfa6686b3182b41239668a0b4675b130af88b8 (2026-08-28) with
`node src/build.js`.

It keeps the tests groq-js runs for GROQ 1.2.0: features portableText,
customFunctions, internalDocuments and contentReleases only, no perf files, and
only datasets embedded in the suite (the external movies dataset is excluded).
Each line is a dataset ({_type: "dataset", _id, documents}) or a test
({_type: "test", name, filename, query, result, valid, params, dataset, features}).

Regenerate with tooling/groq/build-conformance-fixture.mjs from the release
asset suite.ndjson (v1.0.5).
